>>  	unsigned long flags;
>>  
>> +	if (!d)
>> +		return;
>> +
>> +	pp = irq_data_get_irq_chip_data(d);
> 
> Well, we do not validate pp either and I wonder whether coverity trips
> over this code path but that's just a false positive.
